OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AIsraeli attacks have turned Gaza into  
OL,4,A'toxic wasteland', Oxfam says          
OL,6,FOxfam International's executive        
OL,7,Fdirector, Amitabh Behar, said the      
OL,8,Fimpact on Gaza "will have fundamentally
OL,9,Fdegraded the environmental conditions  
OL,10,Fnecessary for human safety and         
OL,11,Fsurvival".                             
OL,13,FIn response, the Israeli embassy in the
OL,14,FUK said the report "falls short of     
OL,15,Fprofessional standards".               
